00:05:10.815 --> 00:05:23.055
<v Slow>また、住所や電話番号など、品物を届けるための情報も、およそ78万件ありました。

00:05:23.855 --> 00:05:30.983
<v Host>There were also about seven hundred eighty thousand records for delivering goods, like addresses and phone numbers.

00:05:31.584 --> 00:05:33.959
<v Vocab>届ける

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:36.831
<v Host>It means to deliver something to someone.

00:05:37.432 --> 00:05:46.744
<v Slow>今の会員だけでなく、やめてから3年以内の人の情報も含まれています。

00:05:47.543 --> 00:05:53.567
<v Host>Not only current members are affected, but also people who quit within the last three years.

00:05:54.168 --> 00:05:56.663
<v Vocab>含まれる

00:05:57.064 --> 00:05:58.935
<v Host>It means to be included.

00:05:59.536 --> 00:06:06.303
<v Slow>クレジットカードの情報は、漏れていないということです。

00:06:07.103 --> 00:06:09.935
<v Host>Credit card information did not leak.

00:06:10.536 --> 00:06:21.048
<v Slow>通信販売のサイトは今も止まっていて、いつ再開するかは、まだ決まっていません。

00:06:21.848 --> 00:06:26.887
<v Host>The online shop is still closed, and there is no date yet for when it will open again.

00:06:27.487 --> 00:06:30.295
<v Vocab>再開する

00:06:30.696 --> 00:06:33.264
<v Host>It means to start again after a stop.

00:06:33.863 --> 00:06:43.992
<v Slow>すでに注文された商品は、23日から順番に送り始めるということです。

00:06:44.791 --> 00:06:50.552
<v Host>Items people already ordered will start shipping, one after another, from the twenty-third.

00:06:51.151 --> 00:07:01.327
<v Slow>会社は、タワーレコードのふりをした怪しいメールに、気をつけるよう呼びかけています。

00:07:02.127 --> 00:07:08.391
<v Host>The company is warning people to watch out for suspicious emails that pretend to be from Tower Records.

00:07:08.992 --> 00:07:11.415
