00:07:11.815 --> 00:07:14.408
<v Host>It means suspicious, or fishy.

00:07:15.007 --> 00:07:25.375
<v Slow>メールの中のリンクを開いたり、個人情報を入力したりしないでほしいと話しています。

00:07:26.175 --> 00:07:31.288
<v Host>It asks people not to open links in those emails or type in their personal details.

00:07:31.887 --> 00:07:34.552
<v Vocab>入力する

00:07:34.951 --> 00:07:38.072
<v Host>It means to type in, or enter information.

00:07:38.672 --> 00:07:49.232
<v Slow>また、ほかのサイトで同じパスワードを使っている人には、すぐに変えるよう勧めています。

00:07:50.031 --> 00:07:55.336
<v Host>It also tells people who use the same password on other sites to change it right away.

00:07:55.935 --> 00:07:58.384
<v Vocab>勧める

00:07:58.783 --> 00:08:02.887
<v Host>It means to recommend, or advise someone to do something.

